# Android release signing (UAT-MOB-02). credentials.json holds the keystore passwords that EAS uses to
# sign a build; the keystore itself lives outside the repository. Neither may ever be committed — the
# permanent S4 signing identity is valid to 2056 and losing or leaking it cannot be undone.
